ils for plugins as a security measure.<br>We\'ve <a class="llar_bold link__style_color_inherit" href="%s" target="_blank">created an article</a> to troubleshoot common email deliverability issues.','Weekly Digest'=>'Weekly Digest','* Requests are utilized when the cloud app validates an IP address before it is able to perform a login.'=>'* Requests are utilised when the cloud app validates an IP address before it is able to perform a login.','Help us secure our network by sharing your login IP data. In return, receive limited access to our premium features up to 1,000 requests for the first month, and 100 requests each subsequent month. Once requests are exceeded for a given month, the premium app will switch to FREE and reset the following month.'=>'Help us secure our network by sharing your login IP data. In return, receive limited access to our premium features up to 1,000 requests for the first month, and 100 requests each subsequent month. Once requests are exceeded for a given month, the premium app will switch to FREE and reset the following month.','Receive a weekly digest that includes a recap of your failed logins and lockout notifications. Premium users will be able to see additional data such as countries and IPs with most failed logins.'=>'Receive a weekly digest that includes a recap of your failed logins and lockout notifications. Premium users will be able to see additional data such as countries and IPs with most failed logins.','This makes the plugin <a href="%s" class="unlink link__style_unlink" target="_blank">GDPR</a> compliant by showing a message on the login page. <a href="%s" class="unlink llar-label" target="_blank">Read more</a>'=>'This makes the plugin <a href="%s" class="unlink link__style_unlink" target="_blank">GDPR</a> compliant by showing a message on the login page. <a href="%s" class="unlink llar-label" target="_blank">Read more</a>','You are currently using Micro Cloud, which provides access to premium cloud app on a limited basis. To prevent interruption, upgrade to one of our paid plans below.'=>'You are currently using Micro Cloud, which provides access to premium cloud app on a limited basis. To prevent interruption, upgrade to one of our paid plans below.','Unblock The Blocked Admins Effortlessly'=>'Unblock The Blocked Admins Effortlessly','Automatically Add Malicious IPs To Your Deny List'=>'Automatically Add Malicious IPs To Your Deny List','Identify & Counter New Threats With Ease'=>'Identify & Counter New Threats With Ease','<a class="link__style_unlink llar_turquoise" href="#llar_auto_update_choice">Enable automatic updates</a> to ensure that the plugin stays current with the latest software patches and features.'=>'<a class="link__style_unlink llar_turquoise" href="#llar_auto_update_choice">Enable automatic updates</a> to ensure that the plugin stays current with the latest software patches and features.','<a class="link__style_unlink llar_turquoise" href="%s">Enable email notifications</a> to receive timely alerts and updates via email.'=>'<a class="link__style_unlink llar_turquoise" href="%s">Enable email notifications</a> to receive timely alerts and updates via email.','Automate your denylist with IP intelligence when you <a href="%s" class="unlink link__style_unlink" target="_blank">upgrade to premium</a>.'=>'Automate your denylist with IP intelligence when you <a href="%s" class="unlink link__style_unlink" target="_blank">upgrade to premium</a>.','Automatic switch to free version when premium stops working (usually due to non-payment or exceeding monthly resource budget).'=>'Automatic switch to free version when premium stops working (usually due to non-payment or exceeding monthly resource budget).','Contact Support'=>'Contact Support','Deny IPs By Country'=>'Deny IPs By Country','Deny/Allow countries (Premium+ Users)'=>'Deny/Allow countries (Premium+ Users)','Enable Micro Cloud (FREE)'=>'Enable Micro Cloud (FREE)','Enable automatic updates to ensure that the plugin stays c